						"base": "2d",
						"armor_divisor": 3
					},
					"reach": "1",
					"parry": "0",
					"usage": "Standard",
					"usage_notes": "Rending: on a hit that succeeds by 5 or more, or on a critical hit, use the Rending hit line below instead of this one (roll the same damage dice, but apply divisor (10)) — framework.md's own rending rule, priced here as a conditional reinterpretation of an already-bought hit rather than a separately-purchased ability, since it never triggers without this weapon's own attack roll succeeding well in the first place.",
					"defaults": [
