			"local_notes": "Lore: A Genestealer's four clawed limbs strike faster and more precisely than almost anything else the swarm fields.\n\nDesign: DX+3 (19) for 8 points, Easy — matching the rending claws' own natural-weapon attack roll, used for both of its Extra Attack strikes.",
